✅ TC01 – Verify “Product” and “Solution” facets appear under Content Type

Steps:

Navigate to the Search Page.

Check the Content Type section in the left filter panel.
Expected Result:

“Product” and “Solution” facets are visible and listed alphabetically.

✅ TC02 – Verify filtering by Product and Solution returns correct results

Steps:

Click Product under Content Type.

Observe search results.

Clear Product and click Solution.
Expected Result:

Product filter shows only pages with Page Location = Products.

Solution filter shows only pages with Page Location = Solutions.

No irrelevant pages appear.

✅ TC03 – Verify facets work for all languages

Steps:

Change site language (EN → FR → JP → etc.).

Navigate to the Search Page.

Check the Content Type section.
Expected Result:

“Product” and “Solution” facets appear correctly in each language and behave the same when filtering.
